(Fields!DayClose.Value-Fields!MA60.Value)/Fields!MA60.Value&gt;=0 and Fields!MA60.Value&lt;&gt;0,"Red",
(Fields!DayClose.Value-Fields!MA60.Value)/Fields!MA60.Value&lt;0 and Fields!MA60.Value&lt;&gt;0,"Green",
0=0,"Black")</Color>
