          <Textbox Name="Textbox10">
            <CanGrow>true</CanGrow>
            <KeepTogether>true</KeepTogether>
            <Paragraphs>
              <Paragraph>
                <TextRuns>
                  <TextRun>
                    <Value />
                    <Style>
                      <FontStyle>Normal</FontStyle>
                      <FontFamily>Times New Roman</FontFamily>
                      <FontSize>12pt</FontSize>
                      <FontWeight>Normal</FontWeight>
                      <TextDecoration>None</TextDecoration>
                      <Color>Red</Color>
                    </Style>
                  </TextRun>
                </TextRuns>
                <Style />
              </Paragraph>
            </Paragraphs>
            <rd:DefaultName>Textbox10</rd:DefaultName>
            <Top>7.31689cm</Top>
            <Height>0.95983cm</Height>
            <Width>30.18147cm</Width>
            <ZIndex>1</ZIndex>
            <Style>
              <Border>
                <Style>None</Style>
              </Border>
              <PaddingLeft>2pt</PaddingLeft>
              <PaddingRight>2pt</PaddingRight>
              <PaddingTop>2pt</PaddingTop>
              <PaddingBottom>2pt</PaddingBottom>
            </Style>
          </Textbox>
          <Textbox Name="Textbox12">
            <CanGrow>true</CanGrow>
            <KeepTogether>true</KeepTogether>
            <Paragraphs>
              <Paragraph>
                <TextRuns>
                  <TextRun>
                    <Value>如果大盤是</Value>
                    <Style>
                      <FontStyle>Normal</FontStyle>
                      <FontFamily>Times New Roman</FontFamily>
                      <FontSize>12pt</FontSize>
                      <FontWeight>Normal</FontWeight>
                      <TextDecoration>None</TextDecoration>
                      <Color>#000000</Color>
                    </Style>
                  </TextRun>
                  <TextRun>
                    <Value>多头</Value>
                    <Style>
                      <FontStyle>Normal</FontStyle>
                      <FontFamily>Times New Roman</FontFamily>
                      <FontSize>12pt</FontSize>
                      <FontWeight>Bold</FontWeight>
                      <TextDecoration>None</TextDecoration>
                      <Color>Red</Color>
                    </Style>
                  </TextRun>
                  <TextRun>
                    <Value>，那么回档是选股的好时机。什么是好时机呢？时机有三种：</Value>
                    <Style>
                      <FontStyle>Normal</FontStyle>
                      <FontFamily>Times New Roman</FontFamily>
                      <FontSize>12pt</FontSize>
                      <FontWeight>Normal</FontWeight>
                      <TextDecoration>None</TextDecoration>
                      <Color>#000000</Color>
                    </Style>
                  </TextRun>
                  <TextRun>
                    <Value>1.盘中疯狂急杀。2.开很低走高收长红。3.量缩筑底。</Value>
                    <Style>
                      <FontStyle>Normal</FontStyle>
                      <FontFamily>Times New Roman</FontFamily>
                      <FontSize>12pt</FontSize>
                      <FontWeight>Bold</FontWeight>
                      <TextDecoration>None</TextDecoration>
                      <Color>#000000</Color>
                    </Style>
                  </TextRun>
                  <TextRun>
                    <Value>这大概就是好时机了。</Value>
                    <Style>
                      <FontStyle>Normal</FontStyle>
                      <FontFamily>Times New Roman</FontFamily>
                      <FontSize>12pt</FontSize>
                      <FontWeight>Normal</FontWeight>
                      <TextDecoration>None</TextDecoration>
                      <Color>#000000</Color>
                    </Style>
                  </TextRun>
                </TextRuns>
                <Style />
              </Paragraph>
              <Paragraph>
                <TextRuns>
                  <TextRun>
                    <Value>把你想做的股票名单准备好，让市场告诉你什么时候进场，设好停损，进场后就是让市场验证你的思维，交易就是这么简单。</Value>
                    <Style>
                      <FontStyle>Normal</FontStyle>
                      <FontFamily>Times New Roman</FontFamily>
                      <FontSize>12pt</FontSize>
                      <FontWeight>Normal</FontWeight>
                      <TextDecoration>None</TextDecoration>
                      <Color>Tomato</Color>
                    </Style>
                  </TextRun>
                </TextRuns>
                <LeftIndent>0cm</LeftIndent>
                <RightIndent>0cm</RightIndent>
                <Style>
                  <TextAlign>Left</TextAlign>
                </Style>
              </Paragraph>
            </Paragraphs>
            <rd:DefaultName>Textbox12</rd:DefaultName>
            <Top>4.44472cm</Top>
            <Height>1.29144cm</Height>
            <Width>30.18147cm</Width>
            <ZIndex>2</ZIndex>
            <Style>
              <Border>
                <Style>None</Style>
              </Border>
              <PaddingLeft>2pt</PaddingLeft>
              <PaddingRight>2pt</PaddingRight>
              <PaddingTop>2pt</PaddingTop>
              <PaddingBottom>2pt</PaddingBottom>
            </Style>
          </Textbox>
          <Textbox Name="Textbox14">
            <CanGrow>true</CanGrow>
            <KeepTogether>true</KeepTogether>
            <Paragraphs>
              <Paragraph>
                <TextRuns>
                  <TextRun>
                    <Value>看对看错都是猜的，跟你没关系，做对做错才是真的。重点不在预测，而是在当下的抉择。
如果你还没体认到金融的不确定性，如果你不理解交易跟写程式一样是一种实作，如果你不明白当下的抉择才是胜负的关键，那还是别进来金融市场的好。</Value>
                    <Style>
                      <FontStyle>Normal</FontStyle>
                      <FontFamily>Times New Roman</FontFamily>
                      <FontSize>12pt</FontSize>
                      <FontWeight>Normal</FontWeight>
                      <TextDecoration>None</TextDecoration>
                      <Color>Tomato</Color>
                    </Style>
                  </TextRun>
                </TextRuns>
                <Style />
              </Paragraph>
            </Paragraphs>
            <rd:DefaultName>Textbox14</rd:DefaultName>
            <Top>2.91253cm</Top>
            <Height>1.3558cm</Height>
            <Width>30.18147cm</Width>
            <ZIndex>3</ZIndex>
            <Style>
              <Border>
                <Style>None</Style>
              </Border>
              <PaddingLeft>2pt</PaddingLeft>
              <PaddingRight>2pt</PaddingRight>
              <PaddingTop>2pt</PaddingTop>
              <PaddingBottom>2pt</PaddingBottom>
            </Style>
          </Textbox>
          <Textbox Name="Textbox15">
            <CanGrow>true</CanGrow>
            <KeepTogether>true</KeepTogether>
            <Paragraphs>
              <Paragraph>
                <TextRuns>
                  <TextRun>
                    <Value>大盘</Value>
                    <Style>
                      <FontFamily>Times New Roman</FontFamily>
                      <FontSize>12pt</FontSize>
                    </Style>
                  </TextRun>
                  <TextRun>
                    <Value>空头</Value>
                    <Style>
                      <FontFamily>Times New Roman</FontFamily>
                      <FontSize>12pt</FontSize>
                      <FontWeight>Bold</FontWeight>
                      <Color>Green</Color>
                    </Style>
                  </TextRun>
                  <TextRun>
                    <Value>的时候，是</Value>
                    <Style>
                      <FontFamily>Times New Roman</FontFamily>
                      <FontSize>12pt</FontSize>
                    </Style>
                  </TextRun>
                  <TextRun>
                    <Value>最好选择波段交易标的</Value>
                    <Style>
                      <FontFamily>Times New Roman</FontFamily>
                      <FontSize>12pt</FontSize>
                      <FontWeight>Bold</FontWeight>
                    </Style>
                  </TextRun>
                  <TextRun>
                    <Value>，因为大盘空头，覆巢之下无完卵，所有股票都会受影响。
跟大盘比，</Value>
                    <Style>
                      <FontFamily>Times New Roman</FontFamily>
                      <FontSize>12pt</FontSize>
                    </Style>
                  </TextRun>
                  <TextRun>
                    <Value>谁先回到大盘的起跌点</Value>
                    <Style>
                      <FontFamily>Times New Roman</FontFamily>
                      <FontSize>12pt</FontSize>
                      <FontWeight>Bold</FontWeight>
                    </Style>
                  </TextRun>
                  <TextRun>
                    <Value>，那可能就是未来的主流，未来的领导股。</Value>
                    <Style>
                      <FontFamily>Times New Roman</FontFamily>
                      <FontSize>12pt</FontSize>
                    </Style>
                  </TextRun>
                </TextRuns>
                <Style />
              </Paragraph>
            </Paragraphs>
            <rd:DefaultName>Textbox15</rd:DefaultName>
            <Top>5.842cm</Top>
            <Height>1.36906cm</Height>
            <Width>30.18147cm</Width>
            <ZIndex>4</ZIndex>
            <Style>
              <Border>
                <Style>None</Style>
              </Border>
              <PaddingLeft>2pt</PaddingLeft>
              <PaddingRight>2pt</PaddingRight>
              <PaddingTop>2pt</PaddingTop>
              <PaddingBottom>2pt</PaddingBottom>
            </Style>
          </Textbox>
          <Textbox Name="Textbox7">
            <CanGrow>true</CanGrow>
            <KeepTogether>true</KeepTogether>
            <Paragraphs>
              <Paragraph>
                <TextRuns>
                  <TextRun>
                    <Value>多頭行情 </Value>
                    <Style>
                      <FontStyle>Normal</FontStyle>
                      <FontFamily>Times New Roman</FontFamily>
                      <FontSize>18pt</FontSize>
                      <FontWeight>Normal</FontWeight>
                      <TextDecoration>None</TextDecoration>
                      <Color>Red</Color>
